A frustrated figure sitting cross-legged on a living room floor, tangled in a chaotic nest of ethernet cables and wireless router antennas, rendered in bold comic book style with dramatic halftone dots and thick black outlines. The router device at the center glows an angry red, with wavy signal lines emanating outward that visibly fragment and dissolve into static. Multiple devices—laptop, phone, tablet—float around the person, each showing buffering symbols. The color palette features punchy primary colors: electric blue, fire engine red, and bright yellow against stark white backgrounds. Dynamic action lines radiate from the malfunctioning router, suggesting technological chaos. The person's expression shows exasperated defeat, hair slightly disheveled, one hand raised in a questioning gesture toward the uncooperative equipment. Small lightning bolt symbols indicate the intermittent connection failures throughout the scene.
